      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Physical liquid waste at an industrial establishment. This broad material identity includes wastewater and other discarded liquids. The reference quantity is total liquid-stream mass, including water and any dissolved or suspended constituents. Composition, hazardous classification, prior processing and subsequent treatment or receiving fate are specified by the consuming Process; none is fixed by this Flow. The dataset does not itself represent a collection or treatment service, or an elementary emission. Overall compliance has not been independently certified.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "工业企业边界处的物理液态废物。本通用物料身份包括废水及其他弃置液体。参考量为含水及溶解、悬浮组分的液流总质量。组成、危险性分类、前序处理及后续处理或接收去向由使用该流的过程说明，本流不预设这些条件。该数据集本身不表示收集或处理服务，也不表示基本环境排放。整体合规性尚未经独立认证。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
